{"id": 15381, "title": "Changing Lifestyle", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "changing-lifestyle", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/15381_changing-lifestyle.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["小张是一个年轻的白领，每天都要上班。他的工作很忙，经常要加班到深夜。由于长时间的工作，又缺乏运动，他变得越来越不健康。他的朋友很担心，于是给他推荐了一个健身俱乐部。小张也想改变自己的生活方式，于是开始去健身俱乐部锻炼身体。慢慢地，他发现自己的身体不但变得更加健康有活力，还能更好地应对工作和生活的挑战。通过定期的健身训练，小张不仅保持了健康，还在俱乐部交到了新的朋友，让他的生活变得更加充实和快乐。他很感激他朋友们的关心和鼓励，也感谢健身给他带来的变化。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["小張是一個年輕的白領，每天都要上班。他的工作很忙，經常要加班到深夜。由於長時間的工作，又缺乏運動，他變得越來越不健康。他的朋友很擔心，於是給他推薦了一個健身俱樂部。小張也想改變自己的生活方式，於是開始去健身俱樂部鍛鍊身體。慢慢地，他發現自己的身體不但變得更加健康有活力，還能更好地應對工作和生活的挑戰。通過定期的健身訓練，小張不僅保持了健康，還在俱樂部交到了新的朋友，讓他的生活變得更加充實和快樂。他很感激他朋友們的關心和鼓勵，也感謝健身給他帶來的變化。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["xiǎo zhāng shì yī gè nián qīng de bái lǐng， měi tiān dōu yào shàng bān。 tā de gōng zuò hěn máng， jīng cháng yào jiā bān dào shēn yè。 yóu yú cháng shí jiān de gōng zuò， yòu quē fá yùn dòng， tā biàn de yuè lái yuè bù jiàn kāng。 tā de péng you hěn dān xīn， yú shì gěi tā tuī jiàn le yī gè jiàn shēn jù lè bù。 xiǎo zhāng yě xiǎng gǎi biàn zì jǐ de shēng huó fāng shì， yú shì kāi shǐ qù jiàn shēn jù lè bù duàn liàn shēn tǐ。 màn màn de， tā fā xiàn zì jǐ de shēn tǐ bù dàn biàn de gèng jiā jiàn kāng yǒu huó lì， hái néng gèng hǎo de yìng duì gōng zuò hé shēng huó de tiǎo zhàn。 tōng guò dìng qī de jiàn shēn xùn liàn， xiǎo zhāng bù jǐn bǎo chí le jiàn kāng， hái zài jù lè bù jiāo dào le xīn de péng you， ràng tā de shēng huó biàn de gèng jiā chōng shí hé kuài lè。 tā hěn gǎn jī tā péng you men de guān xīn hé gǔ lì， yě gǎn xiè jiàn shēn gěi tā dài lái de biàn huà。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Xiao Zhang is a young white-collar worker who has to go to work every day. He is very busy at work and often has to work overtime until late at night. Due to long hours of work and lack of exercise, he became increasingly unhealthy. His friend was worried and recommended a fitness club to him. Xiao Zhang also wanted to change his lifestyle, so he started going to a health club to exercise. Slowly, he found that his body not only became healthier and more energetic, but also better able to cope with the challenges of work and life. Through regular fitness training, Xiao Zhang not only stayed healthy, but also made new friends at the club, making his life more fulfilling and happy. He is grateful for the care and encouragement from his friends and the changes that fitness has brought to him."], "english_full": "Xiao Zhang is a young white-collar worker who has to go to work every day. He is very busy at work and often has to work overtime until late at night. Due to long hours of work and lack of exercise, he became increasingly unhealthy. His friend was worried and recommended a fitness club to him. Xiao Zhang also wanted to change his lifestyle, so he started going to a health club to exercise. Slowly, he found that his body not only became healthier and more energetic, but also better able to cope with the challenges of work and life. Through regular fitness training, Xiao Zhang not only stayed healthy, but also made new friends at the club, making his life more fulfilling and happy. He is grateful for the care and encouragement from his friends and the changes that fitness has brought to him.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo zhāng\" data-defn=\"a familiar way to refer to someone surnamed Zhang; literally &quot;Little Zhang&quot;\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">小张</span><span class=\"tr\">小張</span><rt>xiǎo zhāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nián qīng\" data-defn=\"young\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">年轻</span><span class=\"tr\">年輕</span><rt>nián qīng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bái lǐng\" data-defn=\"white-collar worker\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">白领</span><span class=\"tr\">白領</span><rt>bái lǐng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"měi\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tiān\" data-defn=\"day\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"will; shall; about to / need to; should / if\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng bān\" data-defn=\"to go to work / to be on duty / to start work / to go to the office\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">上班</span><span class=\"tr\">上班</span><rt>shàng bān</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gōng zuò\" data-defn=\"job / work / task\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"máng\" data-defn=\"busy\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">忙</span><span class=\"tr\">忙</span><rt>máng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīng cháng\" data-defn=\"frequently; constantly; regularly; often\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"will; shall; about to / need to; should / if\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā bān\" data-defn=\"to work overtime\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">加班</span><span class=\"tr\">加班</span><rt>jiā bān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dào\" data-defn=\"to reach; to arrive / to (a place); until (a time); up to (a point) / (verb complement indicating arriving at a place or reaching a point)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shēn\" data-defn=\"(lit. and fig.) deep\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">深</span><span class=\"tr\">深</span><rt>shēn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yè\" data-defn=\"night\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">夜</span><span class=\"tr\">夜</span><rt>yè</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yóu yú\" data-defn=\"due to / as a result of / thanks to / owing to / since / because\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">由于</span><span class=\"tr\">由於</span><rt>yóu yú</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cháng\" data-defn=\"long\