pan class=\"si\">健康</span><span class=\"tr\">健康</span><rt>jiàn kāng</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péng you\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng you</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dān xīn\" data-defn=\"anxious / worried / uneasy\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">担心</span><span class=\"tr\">擔心</span><rt>dān xīn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yú shì\" data-defn=\"thereupon; as a result; consequently; thus; hence\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">于是</span><span class=\"tr\">於是</span><rt>yú shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gěi\" data-defn=\"to / for / for the benefit of / to do sth (for sb)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tuī jiàn\" data-defn=\"to recommend\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">推荐</span><span class=\"tr\">推薦</span><rt>tuī jiàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiàn shēn\" data-defn=\"physical exercise\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">健身</span><span class=\"tr\">健身</span><rt>jiàn shēn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jù lè bù\" data-defn=\"(loanword) club (the organization or its premises)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">俱乐部</span><span class=\"tr\">俱樂部</span><rt>jù lè bù</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo zhāng\" data-defn=\"a familiar way to refer to someone surnamed Zhang; literally &quot;Little Zhang&quot;\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">小张</span><span class=\"tr\">小張</span><rt>xiǎo zhāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yě\" data-defn=\"also; too; as well; (not ...) either\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to desire; to want (to)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gǎi biàn\" data-defn=\"to change / to alter / to transform\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">改变</span><span class=\"tr\">改變</span><rt>gǎi biàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zì jǐ\" data-defn=\"oneself; (attributive) one&#x27;s own\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">自己</span><span class=\"tr\">自己</span><rt>zì jǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><s